**Here is a digital copy of the activity guide if needed:**  [Brand Analysis](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1MH4cVQG4lyMhTIw234ihK72bdvcEEARNBitqn3N0hYc/edit?usp=sharing).

###Do This
1. If completing this activity digitally, open the digital Brand Analysis Activity Guide.
2. Look at the images in the panels on Level 2. Compare each pair of websites (Nike vs Adidas, Spotify vs SoundCloud, etc). 
3. Record what you notice about color, typography, layout, and overall tone. 
4. Based on these design choices, explain which audience each brand seems to target.




